            <description><![CDATA[
                    <ul>
                        <li>New compress mode: directly reduce the size of JPG, WebP, PNG, GIF, TIFF, AVIF, and PDF files without converting them first.</li>
                        <li>Option to compress images after converting them to JPG, WebP, PNG, GIF, TIFF, AVIF, or PDF.</li>
                        <li>Minor improvements and bug fixes.</li>
                    </ul>
                ]]></description>
        </item>
